    "detailed_description": "<strong>Read the forgotten journals. Rally the outcast horde. Crack the rune\u2011box before the world forgets the goblins were ever here.</strong><br><br>Puzzle out the field notes of a long\u2011lost goblin commander, plot a path across shifting battle maps, and watch your carefully loaded squads clash in turn\u2011based auto\u2011battles.<br><br>Each journal becomes your next roguelite campaign: three escalating parchment maps, dozens of ambushes and intrigues, and a last\u2011stand finale whose outcome rewrites the legend. <br><br>Will your translations redeem the scattered clans\u2014or doom them to fade into myth forever?<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Plan, Place, Watch Chaos Unfold</strong> \u2013 Slot abilities before each turn\u2011based auto battle, then adapt between rounds as enemy tactics mutate.  <br></li><li><strong>Nine Hand\u2011Authored \u201cRuns\u201d</strong> \u2013 Every journal shuffles 70+ combat encounters, 30+ narrative events, and fort hubs for hiring, healing, or shopping.<br></li><li><strong>Four Tactical Archetypes</strong> \u2013 Commander, Shield, Pair, and Bulky each wield 6 skills that steer AI behaviour.  <br></li><li><strong>30+ Run\u2011Changing items</strong> \u2013 Torch\u2011lit talismans, poisoned provisions, map\u2011wide tricks\u2014mix them for brutal synergies or last\u2011second clutch saves.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Read the forgotten journals. Rally the outcast horde. Crack the rune\u2011box before the world forgets the goblins were ever here.</strong><br><br>Puzzle out the field notes of a long\u2011lost goblin commander, plot a path across shifting battle maps, and watch your carefully loaded squads clash in turn\u2011based auto\u2011battles.<br><br>Each journal becomes your next roguelite campaign: three escalating parchment maps, dozens of ambushes and intrigues, and a last\u2011stand finale whose outcome rewrites the legend. <br><br>Will your translations redeem the scattered clans\u2014or doom them to fade into myth forever?<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Plan, Place, Watch Chaos Unfold</strong> \u2013 Slot abilities before each turn\u2011based auto battle, then adapt between rounds as enemy tactics mutate.  <br></li><li><strong>Nine Hand\u2011Authored \u201cRuns\u201d</strong> \u2013 Every journal shuffles 70+ combat encounters, 30+ narrative events, and fort hubs for hiring, healing, or shopping.<br></li><li><strong>Four Tactical Archetypes</strong> \u2013 Commander, Shield, Pair, and Bulky each wield 6 skills that steer AI behaviour.  <br></li><li><strong>30+ Run\u2011Changing items</strong> \u2013 Torch\u2011lit talismans, poisoned provisions, map\u2011wide tricks\u2014mix them for brutal synergies or last\u2011second clutch saves.</li></ul>",
